(7295640, 1137763, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here that I''m not getting. I''m going to guess that there was originally an alien spaceship in the background and you cloned it out because it was a major distracting element.</td>', 'There''s a story here that I''m not getting. I''m going to guess that there was originally an alien spaceship in the background and you cloned it out because it was a major distracting element.', '2014-12-26 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295642, 1137550, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m guessing the rule you broke was removing major elements. I think there was originally a dead body in the scene that you removed.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m guessing the rule you broke was removing major elements. I think there was originally a dead body in the scene that you removed.', '2014-12-26 00:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295644, 1137802, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now that''s cool looking!</td>', 'Now that''s cool looking!', '2014-12-26 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295647, 1137763, 13077, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I didn''t really like this. But as I looked around at the elements, I found that the really come together well. Between the frame-within-a-frame of the leftmost tree, shadow, and the lady watching something out of frame; there is a lot of interesting things going on.<br/>A very well caught moment, and I think it will be underrated here.</td>', 'At first glance, I didn''t really like this. But as I looked around at the elements, I found that the really come together well. Between the frame-within-a-frame of the leftmost tree, shadow, and the lady watching something out of frame; there is a lot of interesting things going on.A very well caught moment, and I think it will be underrated here.', '2014-12-26 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
