(7296055, 1137542, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and a beautiful woman, but anyone who gobbles up birds out of the air scares me.<br/> <br/>The edge of the water seems to end too neatly and I can see some evidence of it around her upper right arm (I didn''t spot that until after looking at it for a few minutes, the 3 second voters will probably miss it completely). So I think pasting in the forest background was your rule breaking.</td>', 'Lovely scene and a beautiful woman, but anyone who gobbles up birds out of the air scares me. The edge of the water seems to end too neatly and I can see some evidence of it around her upper right arm (I didn''t spot that until after looking at it for a few minutes, the 3 second voters will probably miss it completely). So I think pasting in the forest background was your rule breaking.', '2014-12-27 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
