(7297960, 1137677, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red.  I''m thinking the cloning out of the wire would''ve been the main point for a DQ. Without dodging/burning, playing around with the contrast levels and some selective color would create a very similar low key effect and make the wire even less visible, if then cloned out wouldn''t have been a major element anymore?</td>', 'Congrats on the Red.  I''m thinking the cloning out of the wire would''ve been the main point for a DQ. Without dodging/burning, playing around with the contrast levels and some selective color would create a very similar low key effect and make the wire even less visible, if then cloned out wouldn''t have been a major element anymore?', '2015-01-02 12:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
