(7299818, 1137752, 37858, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a fine image, Deb.  You''ve framed everything so well and the colors are stunning. ...and I agree about the use of a tripod.  I take mine everywhere.  (It has a lot of beach sand too.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-01-07 11:52:17.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on a fine image, Deb.  You''ve framed everything so well and the colors are stunning. ...and I agree about the use of a tripod.  I take mine everywhere.  (It has a lot of beach sand too.)', '2015-01-07 11:46:52.000000', '2015-01-07 11:52:17.000000', 0),
